<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel sets 20 ctv cash dividend.</title>
<headline>San Miguel sets 20 ctv cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food and beer conglomerate San Miguel Corp said on Friday its board had approved a 20 centavo cash dividend for shareholders as of June 27.</p>
<p>The payment date was set for July 25, and the ex-dividend date June 18.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
